+# Local mDNS subtype support
+
+Based on the unmodified mdns-sd 0.20.1 crates.io package, archive SHA-256
+`fb75febbe5fa1837a52fdbd1c735e168286c5c645fc2ddd31526f65c49941c2e`.
+Upstream: https://github.com/keepsimple1/mdns-sd .
+License: Apache-2.0 OR MIT; original license files are retained.
+
+The local changes add multiple DNS-SD subtype PTRs to one service registration.
+Existing single-subtype access remains compatible. The requested subtype is an
+ANSWER, so a known base PTR cannot suppress an otherwise missing app subtype.
+Announcements and goodbyes include every subtype and retain one instance, SRV
+record, host, port and TXT record. Five wire/API regression tests cover this.
+
+Modified upstream sources: src/service_info.rs, src/dns_parser.rs and
+src/service_daemon.rs. No unrelated upstream changes or new dependencies.
+The exact upstream-relative patch is recorded in the lab source artifacts.
